Hi {!Contact.FirstName},

I have been trying to reach you regarding your open account with National Funding.

Your business is still eligible for additional funding in our Renewal Program.

To secure additional funding for your business, please provide the following information:

- Last 6 months of your business bank statements
- Signed application – available upon request (can be sent to you electronically for e-signature)

Please feel free to contact me with any questions regarding your account.

Thank you,
